  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "This problem has subtasks.\n\nChef has a tree of NNN vertices. Vertex iii has the corresponding value AiA_iAi​.\n\nAs a close friend of the chef, he has entrusted you with the task of handling QQQ queries on the tree during your pastime. These queries can be of two types:\n\n\nType 111: Given two integers uuu and xxx, set the value of vertex uuu to xxx.\n\nMore formally, set AuA_uAu​ to xxx.\nType 222: Given two integers uuu and vvv (where u≠vu \\neq vu=v).\n\nLet SSS be the set of all vertices on the shortest path from uuu to vvv.\n\nPrint the minimum value of ⌊Ai+Aj2⌋−(Ai&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Aj)\\displaystyle\\left\\lfloor \\frac{A_i + A_j}{2} \\right\\rfloor - (A_i\\ \\&amp;\\ A_j)⌊2Ai​+Aj​​⌋−(Ai​&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Aj​), where i≠ji \\neq ji=j and i,j∈Si, j \\in Si,j∈S.\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line of input will contain a single integer TTT, denoting the number of test cases.\nEach test case consists of multiple lines of input.\n\nThe first line of each test case contains two space-separated integers NNN and QQQ — the number of vertices of the tree and number of queries, respectively.\nThe next N−1N - 1N−1 lines represent the edges of the tree. The iii-th of them contains two space-separated integers uiu_iui​ and viv_ivi​, denoting an edge between uiu_iui​ and viv_ivi​.\nThe next line contains NNN space-separated integers A1,A2,…,ANA_1, A_2, \\ldots, A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​ - the values assigned to the vertices.\nThe last QQQ lines describe the queries. Each of these QQQ lines will be in one of two forms:\n\n1  u  x1 \\;u \\;x1ux, represents a query of the first type.\n2  u  v2 \\;u \\;v2uv, represents a query of the second type.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each test case, output on a new line the answer to each query of the second type.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤1051 \\leq T \\leq 10^51≤T≤105",
      "1≤N≤1051 \\leq N \\leq 10^51≤N≤105",
      "1≤Q≤1051 \\leq Q \\leq 10^51≤Q≤105",
      "1≤ui,vi≤N1 \\leq u_i, v_i \\leq N1≤ui​,vi​≤N",
      "ui≠viu_i \\neq v_iui​=vi​",
      "0≤Ai,x≤20000 \\leq A_i , x \\leq 20000≤Ai​,x≤2000",
      "The sum of NNN and the sum of QQQ over all test cases both won't exceed 10510^5105.",
      "Subtasks",
      "**Subtask 1 (40 points):** The sum of QQQ over all test cases won't exceed 10410^4104.",
      "**Subtask 2 (60 points):** No further constraints."
